{
    "swagger": "2.0",
    "info": {
        "description": "企业级AI知识库管理平台，支持多租户、RLS数据隔离和向量搜索功能。\n\n## 🔐 认证说明\n所有接口都需要JWT Token认证（从子项目0用户中心获取）。\n使用用户中心的 `/api/v1/auth/login` 接口获取Token。\n\n## ✨ 核心特性\n- 多租户架构：租户/组织/用户三级隔离\n- Row-Level Security (RLS)：数据库级别的数据隔离\n- 三级挂载系统：租户 \u003e 组织 \u003e 用户权限继承\n- 向量搜索：基于pgvector的语义搜索（1024维向量）\n- Redis多层缓存：热点数据缓存优化\n- 完整用户中心集成：统一认证授权",
        "title": "AI知识库管理平台 API",
        "contact": {
            "name": "技术支持",
            "email": "support@saleschampionhub.com"
        },
        "license": {
            "name": "MIT",
            "url": "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
        },
        "version": "1.0"
    },
    "host": "localhost:8080",
    "basePath": "/api/v1",
    "paths": {
        "/knowledge-bases": {
            "get": {
                "security": [
                    {
                        "BearerAuth": []
                    }
                ],
                "description": "分页获取知识库列表，支持多种过滤条件",
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "知识库管理"
                ],
                "summary": "列出知识库",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "default": 20,
                        "description": "每页数量（默认：20）",
                        "name": "limit",
                        "in": "query"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "default": 0,
                        "description": "偏移量（默认：0）",
                        "name": "offset",
                        "in": "query"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "string",
                        "default": "created_at DESC",
                        "description": "排序字段（默认：created_at DESC）",
                        "name": "order_by",
                        "in": "query"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "可见性过滤（public/private/restricted）",
                        "name": "visibility",
                        "in": "query"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "所有者ID过滤",
                        "name": "owner_id",
                        "in": "query"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "搜索关键词（在名称和描述中搜索）",
                        "name": "search",
                        "in": "query"
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "知识库列表",
                        "schema": {
                            "allOf": [
                                {
                                    "$ref": "#/definitions/middleware.SuccessResponse"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "data": {
                                            "type": "object",
                                            "properties": {
                                                "knowledge_bases": {
                                                    "type": "array",
                                                    "items": {
                                                        "$ref": "#/definitions/models.KnowledgeBase"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                "limit": {
                                                    "type": "integer"
                                                },
                                                "offset": {
                                                    "type": "integer"
                                                },
                                                "total": {
                                                    "type": "integer"
                                                }
                                            }
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "未授权",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/middleware.ErrorResponse"
                        }
                    },
                    "500": {
                        "description": "服务器内部错误",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/middleware.ErrorResponse"
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            "post": {
                "security": [
                    {
                        "BearerAuth": []
                    }
